        <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          A comprehensive investigation reveals that thousands of Grokipedia articles are near-identical copies of Wikipedia content, raising serious ethical questions about Elon Musk's claims of innovation and the fundamental premise of AI-generated knowledge.
